@startuml breadknife-provider
participant "Hyprland" as hypr
participant "breadknife（bread）" as bread
participant "系统 DBus 服务" as svc
participant "调节工具" as tools

hypr -> bread: IPC 事件（显示器 / 工作区 / 活动窗口 / 紧急）
bread -> hypr: hyprctl 查询 / dispatcher 切换
bread -> svc: 状态读取 / 媒体操作
bread -> tools: 音量 / 亮度设置
@enduml
